OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Ffurther outbreaks of rain, this heavy
OL,7,Fat first, then becoming mainly dry
OL,8,Flater in the night. Breezy for a time
OL,9,Fthen winds easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FThere will be variable
OL,12,Famounts of cloud with bright spells
OL,13,Fand scattered showers. Gentle to
OL,14,Fmoderate winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt will
OL,17,Fbe an unsettled period with showers or
OL,18,Flonger spells of rain. Breezy at times
OL,19,Ftoo.
